<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Department of Mechanical Engineering | SRM TRP</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

body {
    background: #f4f6f9;
    color: #333;
}

header {
    background: #0b2545;
    color: white;
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
}

header h1 {
    font-size: 28px;
}

header p {
    color: #8ecae6;
    margin-top: 5px;
}

nav {
    background: #13315c;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 25px;
    padding: 12px;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
}

nav a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
}

nav a:hover {
    color: #ffb703;
}

.hero {
    background: linear-gradient(rgba(11,37,69,0.85), rgba(11,37,69,0.85)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581091226825-a6a2a5aee158');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    color: white;
    padding: 80px 20px;
    text-align: center;
}

.hero h2 {
    font-size: 36px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.hero button {
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 12px 25px;
    background: #ffb703;
    border: none;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 5px;
}

section {
    padding: 40px 8%;
}

h2.title {
    color: #0b2545;
    border-left: 6px solid #ffb703;
    padding-left: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
}

.card {
    background: white;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

.card h3 {
    color: #13315c;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.labs {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 15px;
}

.labs span {
    background: #e0e7ff;
    padding: 8px 15px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
}

form {
    background: white;
    padding: 25px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    max-width: 600px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

form input, form textarea, form select {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 10px;
    margin: 8px 0 15px 0;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    border-radius: 5px;
}

form input[type="submit"] {
    background: #0b2545;
    color: white;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
}

form input[type="submit"]:hover {
    background: #13315c;
}

footer {
    background: #0b2545;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 15px;
    margin-top: 20px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>Department of Mechanical Engineering</h1>
    <p>SRM TRP Engineering College, Trichy - Excellence in Design & Manufacturing</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#programs">Programs</a>
    <a href="#labs">Labs</a>
    <a href="#admission">Admission</a>
</nav>

<div class="hero" id="home">
    <h2>Build Machines. Build Future.</h2>
    <p>NBA Accredited | State-of-the-art Workshops | 100% Placement Assistance</p>
    <button onclick="document.getElementById('admission').scrollIntoView()">Apply Now 2026</button>
</div>

<section id="about">
    <h2 class="title">About Department</h2>
    <p>The Department of Mechanical Engineering aims to provide quality technical education and develop skilled engineers with knowledge of design, manufacturing and modern technology.</p>
</section>

<section id="programs">
    <h2 class="title">Our Programs</h2>

    <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
            <h3>B.E Mechanical Engineering</h3>
            <p>Learn machine design, manufacturing, thermodynamics and engineering principles.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>CAD and Design</h3>
            <p>Learn computer-aided design and 3D modelling techniques.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Manufacturing</h3>
            <p>Understand modern manufacturing processes and industrial technology.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="labs">
    <h2 class="title">Our Laboratories</h2>

    <div class="labs">
        <span>CAD Lab</span>
        <span>Physics Lab</span>
        <span>Thermal Engineering Lab</span>
        <span>Manufacturing Lab</span>
        <span>Fluid Mechanics Lab</span>
        <span>Workshop</span>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="admission">
    <h2 class="title">Admission Enquiry</h2>

    <form>
        <label>Full Name</label>
        <input type="text" placeholder="Enter your name" required>

        <label>Email Address</label>
        <input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email" required>

        <label>Phone Number</label>
        <input type="tel" placeholder="Enter your phone number" required>

        <label>Select Course</label>
        <select>
            <option>B.E Mechanical Engineering</option>
        </select>

        <label>Your Message</label>
        <textarea rows="4" placeholder="Enter your message"></textarea>

        <input type="submit" value="Submit Enquiry">
    </form>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 SRM TRP Engineering College. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    <p>Department of Mechanical Engineering</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
